# Local prompt material: the French translations and the worked examples (with their PNGs). The prompts
# an integrator actually needs live in packages/compiler/prompts/ — tracked, and SHIPPED in the npm
# package. Ignoring them here is what forced an integrator to hand-copy the grammar, and a copied
# reference diverges. Root-anchored so the packaged folder is not swept up by the same pattern.
/prompts/

